  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于该模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>《无限交易》是一款极简风格的模组，可防止村民交易锁定，使其始终可用并实现无限交易。我不确定他们从哪里获取物品，但只要涉及绿宝石，他们总能找到办法。流浪商人交易也受支持且默认开启。此功能可在配置文件中关闭。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum's Extra Bundle\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"运行环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>展开详情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>wanderingTraderInfiniteTrades&nbsp;</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>启用后，流浪商人的交易将永远不会锁定。<br><br><span><strong>villagerInfiniteTrades&nbsp;</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true<br>启用后，村民的交易将永远不会锁定。<br><br></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><strong>你可以购买任意数量的物品：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/infinite-trading/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"812\" height=\"479\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/infinite-trading/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"810\" height=\"475\"></strong></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用本模组，前提是下载源必须保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 仓库</a>。感谢支持！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
